# voxely-honest-dsp

`AppSettings::active_preset()` returns the stored `DspPreset` without rewriting `order`.

Preview input is `filter-sample.wav` only. Listen-only loudness belongs on preview playback, not `prepare_transcription`.

Do not keep `MicTune` as a second source of truth.
